SUMMARY:Science on the Street (sound and music science)
DESCRIPTION:Science on the Street is a self-guided\, hands-on look at the 
 science of sound on Palafox Street between Garden and Main in Pensacola\,
  from October 29 to November 8. It has oversized instruments\, tuning for
 ks\, sound-wave displays and acoustics demonstrations. The Pensacola MESS
  Hall runs it as part of Foo Foo Festival\, and it's free.\nPrice: Free\n
 Area: Pensacola\nTimes: Thursday 10/29 to Sunday 11/8 · Sound Booth Fri 
